# Environment variable names only

Copy to `.env.local` for local development. **Never commit real values.**  
Fabricated data only in local and staging.

## App

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=
NODE_ENV=development
```

## Supabase

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Server-only — prefer narrow worker identity over blanket service role (see docs/phase-0/WORKER_AUTHORIZATION.md)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
SUPABASE_DB_URL=
```

## Auth allowlist

```bash
# Comma-separated AITHERAS emails approved to sign in
AUTH_ALLOWLIST_EMAILS=
```

## Durable jobs (Trigger.dev recommended)

```bash
TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY=
TRIGGER_PROJECT_ID=
```

## Optional — Inngest alternative

```bash
INNGEST_EVENT_KEY=
INNGEST_SIGNING_KEY=
```

## Google OAuth (via Supabase provider / Google Cloud)

```bash
# Configured primarily in Supabase + Google Cloud Console; document client IDs out of band
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
```

## Integration placeholders (Phase 0B+ — server only)

```bash
JAZZHR_API_KEY=
# OPENAI — not required for Phase 0; provision before AI enablement
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_PROJECT_ID=
```

## Feature flags / ops

```bash
AI_GLOBAL_KILL_SWITCH=true
```
